# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model weights (large binaries)
# Kept out of git by default — ship them beside the app, or track via Git LFS.
# Remove/relax these lines if you prefer to commit the weights directly.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.keras
*.tflite
**/trainedmodels/**
!**/trainedmodels/models.readme

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bundled redistributable installers (large; fetched via download-conda.bat)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/redistributables/
